# FPK Deterministic Form-Follows-Function

**STANDING DIRECTIVE (Tristan 2026-07-29):** Every sub-component and sub-sub-component of the front powertrain kit has a **form-follows-function** set of characteristics. **Nothing is random. Nothing is decorative. Everything is deterministically calculated** from physics, packaging, duty, materials, and manufacturing constraints — then validated (FEA/dyno/supplier) — not invented for looks.

## The bar

Ask of every leaf (wire enamel, channel cross-section, bus thickness, planet tooth, TIM gap, gate-drive channel, seal lip…):

> What function forces this geometry / material / count / size — and which equation or constraint set produces the number?

| Must be TRUE | Must be FALSE |
|---|---|
| Size, shape, count, material grade derived from load / loss / voltage / speed / flow / strength / creepage / bay | “Looks about right” / silhouette paste |
| Provenance: contract quantity, tool, or named formula seed with OPEN until FEA/supplier | Magic constants with no basis string |
| Universal FFF (function + hand/eye/package) | Product-named random features |
| Covers/housings exist because they close a volume / seal / EMI / service | Orphan blobs in Blender |

## Calculation stack (order)

```
duty + bay + interfaces
  → electrical / magnetic / thermal / fluid / mechanical budgets
  → part geometry + material + manufacturing process
  → mesh / BoM / Excel LIVE from those quantities
  → FEA / dyno / supplier replace seeds (never skip the seed step)
```

Optimisation is **after** the deterministic skeleton — never instead of it.

