## Forbidden

- Random dimensions on windings, busbars, cold-plate channels, gears, fasteners
- Blender morphology not driven by derived mm
- BoM lines without engineering basis
- Claiming “designed” when only decorative labels exist

## Checklist before accepting a part as “in the FPK”

- [ ] Function named (why this part exists)
- [ ] Driving quantities named (V, I, T, ω, Q̇, ΔP, σ, …)
- [ ] Formula or tool path recorded in `basis` / physics node
- [ ] Geometry/material follow from that — not the reverse
- [ ] OPEN listed where only FEA/supplier can close
